Here is the comprehensive, official manual for running your **PlantbreedAIAgent** in Google Colab.

Because Google Colab provides "ephemeral" machines (meaning it wipes everything clean when you close the tab), this guide is built around the **"Master Bootloader"** strategy. This ensures that no matter what happens, you can rebuild your entire complex environment—Python servers, R biometrics, and AI models—with a single click.

